    "content": "1.1.6【添项配凑类型】"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.119,
      0.248,
      0.134
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "▲适用题型：",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.146,
      0.147,
      0.46,
      0.162
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "添项配凑后可以构造利用不等式的题型；",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.175,
      0.248,
      0.19
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "▲方法原理：",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.198,
      0.302,
      0.213
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "常用添项配凑方法：",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.157,
      0.223,
      0.619,
      0.301
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "(1) 单变量观察分母： \\( \\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+\\frac{k}{x-a}&=(x-a)+\\frac{k}{(x-a)}+a\\\\ x+\\frac{k}{mx-a}&=\\frac{(mx-a)}{m}+\\frac{k}{(mx-a)}+\\frac{a}{m}\\end{aligned}\\right. \\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.157,
      0.31,
      0.763,
      0.508
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "(2) 双变量观察分母：\\(\\begin{cases} 2a + 3b + \\frac{1}{a + b} + \\frac{1}{a + 2b} = a + b + \\frac{1}{a + b} + a + 2b + \\frac{1}{a + 2b} \\\\ \\frac{a}{b} + \\frac{b}{a + b} = \\frac{a + b - b}{b} + \\frac{b}{a + b} = \\frac{a + b}{b} + \\frac{b}{a + b} - 1 \\\\ \\frac{3b + 2a}{b} + \\frac{b}{a + b} = \\frac{b + 2b + 2a}{b} + \\frac{b}{a + b} = 1 + \\frac{2(a + b)}{b} + \\frac{b}{a + b} \\\\ a + \\frac{1}{a - b} + \\frac{1}{a + b} = a - b + \\frac{1}{a - b} + a + b + \\frac{1}{a + b} \\end{cases}\\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.157,
      0.517,
      0.598,
      0.564
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "(3) 平方添项： \\( \\frac{a-3b}{a^{2}+9b^{2}}=\\frac{a-3b}{(a-3b)^{2}+6ab}=\\frac{1}{a-3b+\\frac{6ab}{a-3b}} \\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.157,
      0.573,
      0.729,
      0.642
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "(4) 同乘易化简的结构: \\(\\begin{cases} a + b = 1 + \\frac{1}{a} + \\frac{1}{b} \\\\ \\Rightarrow (a + b)^2 = \\left(1 + \\frac{1}{a} + \\frac{1}{b}\\right)(a + b) = (a + b) + 2 + \\frac{b}{a} + \\frac{a}{b} \\end{cases}\\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.146,
      0.653,
      0.848,
      0.695
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "以上只是列举一部分配凑变形的方式，核心在于朝基本不等式方向构造，多观察题干条件，合理配凑，当然还得多练习.",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.146,
      0.707,
      0.829,
      0.738
    ],
    "angle": 0,
